  "title": "One Shoulder One Piece Swimsuits Full Coverage Cutout Mesh Tummy Control Monokini Swimwear",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>Design: </strong>This monokini swimming costume for women features a trendy one-shoulder neckline with a bold cutout mesh style that gives a stylish twist to your swim look. The monokini swimwear for women is thoughtfully designed to cover your body while flattering your natural curves.</p>\n<p><strong>Fabric: </strong>Made from high-quality Polyester &amp; Spandex 4-way stretch fabric, this monokini swimwear for women offers a perfect blend of flexibility and durability. It's soft, skin-friendly, breathable, and feels super comfortable on the body — ideal for long hours of wear.</p>\n<p><strong>Feature:</strong> This Padded monokini one Piece swimsuit for women includes removable chest pads without underwire for a natural shape and light support. It is chlorine resistant, quick-drying, easy-to-clean, and stain-resistant — everything you need in a go-to monokini</p>\n<p><strong>Occasion:</strong> Whether you're heading to the beach, poolside, or a resort vacation, this versatile swim suit set for women is perfect for all your sunny adventures. The chic yet modest style makes it a favorite monokini swimwear for women choice for confident swimmers. swimming suit for women.</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> Softly hand wash to extend product service life of monokini swimming costume for women. The quick-drying high-quality fabric ensures convenience. Refer to the Megaska Size Chart for the best fit.</p>",
